:''Not to be confused with [[Chocolate_Rabbits#Mountain_Rabbits|Crag]], a Mountain Faction Rabbit.''

'''Crag''' is an [[NPC]] located in the {{zone|Forgotten Skull}} and {{Zone|Dungeon Hub}}. They appear after defeating [[Kuudra]] for the first time. They let the player select the tier of [[Kuudra]] they would like to fight.

